  "notes": "TRANSITIVITY:\nIntransitive ({自動詞|じどうし})\n\nCOMPOUND VERB:\n{奮|ふる}う (to rouse, to wield) + {立|た}つ (to stand up)\nConveys rising up with determination or courage.\n\nUSAGE:\n- {勇気|ゆうき}が{奮|ふる}い{立|た}つ (courage is roused)\n- 〜に{奮|ふる}い{立|た}つ (to be inspired by ~)\n- {奮|ふる}い{立|た}って〜する (to muster courage and do ~)\nOften used when someone is inspired, motivated, or challenged to action.\n\nRELATED WORDS:\n- {奮|ふる}う (to rouse, to exert)\n- {奮起|ふんき}する (to rouse oneself)\n- {発奮|はっぷん}する (to be stimulated to action)\n- {立|た}ち{上|あ}がる (to stand up, to rise)",
